/* 16-bit denoise, pre-tone. Each worker receives only a 128-row tile plus a
   two-pixel halo. RGB values are linearised before spatial weights are built;
   re-encoding is delayed until the filtered sample is written. No 8-bit
   intermediate and no full-resolution second destination buffer. The next
   tile is captured BEFORE the current tile is committed, preserving halos. */
